    {
      "id": "2067525473299751108",
      "text": "🌍 Europe is going all out for access to Anthropic's restricted Fable 5 and Mythos 5 models. Commission President Ursula von der Leyen told G7 leaders and tech CEOs: \"It is in our mutual interest that our citizens and companies can safely use the best AI models.\"\n\n🇫🇷 Macron led talks in Évian-les-Bains for a \"trusted partners\" workaround after the US blocked foreign access to the models, warning that without cooperation, \"we will fracture the world,\" with a Western democracies platform planned within the month.",
