      "text": "Anthropic Is Still at Odds With the White House Over Claude Fable 5\n\nAnthropic leaders flew to Washington, DC, to meet with White House officials on Monday. After high-level talks,  𝗝𝗼𝗶𝗻 𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗧𝘄𝗶𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗿 𝗳𝗮𝗺𝗶𝗹𝘆. 𝗙𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗼𝘄 𝘂𝘀! from Wired https://t.co/xL6nwLOFpu https://t.co/bYo2ZlGJAM",
