      "id": "2067524452737257640",
      "text": "Macron presses G7 leaders and tech CEOs for a workaround to Trump’s restrictions on Claude AI models.\n\n- US blocked all foreign nationals from accessing Anthropic's most advanced models, Fable 5 and Mythos 5, citing national security.\n\n- The order forced Anthropic to suspend access for everyone, including its own non-US staff.\n\n- Trump administration has already told the UK: no exemptions.\n\n- Macron is meeting with Dario Amodei and Sam Altman to find a diplomatic solution.\n\n- Polymarket gives just 22% chance the ban is lifted this month.",
